flowchart TD
    A([Start isRomUnique]) --> B[Convert ROM to uppercase]
    B --> C[Initialize i = 0]

    C --> D{i < uniqueRomCount?}
    D -- No --> E[Return True]
    D -- Yes --> F{uniqueRoms == rom?}

    F -- Yes --> G[Return False]
    F -- No --> H[i++]

    H --> D

    E --> I([End])
    G --> I
